-- This file is intentionally catalog-specific. Replace the statements below
-- with the maintenance procedures supported by your writable Iceberg catalog.
-- The production config requires a compaction SQL file so COMPACT is never
-- silently skipped. Typical responsibilities:
--   1. rewrite small data files to the catalog target size;
--   2. rewrite/compact manifests;
--   3. expire snapshots according to retention policy;
--   4. remove catalog-known orphan files after the safety retention window.
--
-- Do not use DELETE+INSERT as a generic substitute: that can duplicate or
-- temporarily expose data depending on the catalog. Use the catalog's native
-- rewrite/expire procedures and validate them in a test namespace first.
SELECT 'configure native catalog compaction here' AS required_action;
